      "id": "Issue 8",
      "title": "Tuscarawas County – Proposed Tax Levy (Additional): Developmental Disabilities",
      "summary": "Asks whether Tuscarawas County may levy an additional property tax of up to 1.2 mills for 10 years, beginning in 2026 and first due in 2027. The money pays for community programs and services of the county board of developmental disabilities and for acquiring, building, renovating, financing, maintaining and operating developmental disabilities facilities. The county auditor estimates it will collect $4,214,524 a year, or $42 for each $100,000 of the auditor's market value.",
